{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>The princes of Balak.</b> And he did not mention the elders of Midian because Balak is the principal and he is the one who sent to him. R. Moses the Kohen the Sephardi, of blessed memory, said: although the sign of the hifil is yod, it is not possible for it to be except with nun, as in הַלְהָרְגֵנִי — one does not say הַלְהָרְגֵי; and behold he forgot to give: לָלֶכֶת עִמָּכֶם לֹא אָבָה יָבְמִי, and R. Jonah the grammarian said that the yod is added — and this is not correct."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:54.832357957Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}